n class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-kīm-gien-giork-gì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>加<rt>게ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>講話<rt>겅ˆ웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn na-si-kē-kông-wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>連鞭<rt>럄미ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>出<rt>춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>代誌<rt>대지</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    liam-mî tio-chût-tai-ji\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>怪<rt>괘ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>落塗時<rt>롷터시ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    koài-gùn’e loh-thor-sí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>拄<rt>두ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>歹<rt>팰ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>八字<rt>뵣ˆ띠ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tû-tioh-phâ̰i-poêh-rī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>好命囝<rt>호ˆ먀걀ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    láng si-hô-mia-kià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做<rt>죄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>兄弟<rt>햘ˉ디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn ti-lêh-joè-hiā̰-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>窗外<rt>탕ˉ꽈ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>野鳥<rt>야ˆᄌᆤˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>替<rt>퇴ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>啼<rt>티ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thāng-goā’e yâ-jiàu thoè-gûn-thí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>人在江湖<rt>띤재강ˉ어ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    rin-jai-kāng-ór\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n